# Build context hygiene for the AltCover development image.
#
# Anything not excluded here is copied into the image by `COPY . .`, which means
# it can end up in a layer that gets pushed to a registry. Two classes of content
# must never be included:
#
#   1. VCS metadata. `.git` carries the entire history, so any credential that
#      was ever committed and later removed is still recoverable from the image.
#   2. Private key material. Build/*.snk are strong-name private keys. They are
#      already public (see SECURITY.md) and must not be redistributed further.

# --- VCS and CI metadata -------------------------------------------------- #
.git
.gitattributes
.gitignore
.github
.travis.yml
appveyor.yml

# --- Secrets and key material --------------------------------------------- #
**/*.snk
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log

# --- Build output (regenerated by the build; can be 100s of MB) ---------- #
**/bin/
**/obj/
packages/
_Packaging/
_Reports/
_Mono/
_Publish/
_Generated/
_Deploy/
_Install/
_Tests/
artifacts/
nupkg/
!nupkg/build/
Build/build.fsx

# --- Editor / OS noise ----------------------------------------------------- #
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
